    <item>
      <title>Director</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/director/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/director/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;director-page-container&#34;&gt;
&lt;div style=&#34;display: flex; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 14px; padding: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);&#34;&gt;
  &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/authors/admin/avatar.png&#34; alt=&#34;Cong-Thanh Vu&#34; style=&#34;width: 170px; height: 170px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 4px solid #f1f5f9;&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div style=&#34;flex: 1; min-width: 280px;&#34;&gt;
    &lt;h2 style=&#34;margin: 0 0 0.3rem; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a;&#34;&gt;Cong-Thanh Vu&lt;/h2&gt;
    &lt;p style=&#34;color: #1565c0; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1.05rem;&#34;&gt;Director, Robotics and Autonomous Systems Laboratory (RASL)&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p style=&#34;color: #475569; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem;&#34;&gt;Assistant Professor, Department of Mechatronics Engineering, School of Mechanical and Automotive Engineering (SMAE), Hanoi University of Industry (HAUI)&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;p style=&#34;font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 0.8rem; color: #334155;&#34;&gt;
      &lt;strong&gt;Email&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href=&#34;mailto:vuthanh.cdt@gmail.com&#34;&gt;vuthanh.cdt@gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;div style=&#34;display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 0.8rem;&#34;&gt;
      &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/publications/&#34; style=&#34;display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 6px 14px; background: #005bac; color: #ffffff; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 650; font-size: 0.88rem; text-decoration: none;&#34;&gt;Publications (14 Papers)&lt;/a&gt;
      &lt;a href=&#34;https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=7FEW5b8AAAAJ&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34; style=&#34;display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 6px 14px; background: #f8fafc; color: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 650; font-size: 0.88rem; text-decoration: none;&#34;&gt;Google Scholar&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;education&#34;&gt;Education&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ph.D.&lt;/strong&gt;, Mechanical Engineering, &lt;strong&gt;National Cheng Kung University (NCKU)&lt;/strong&gt;, Tainan, Taiwan, 2026.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;M.S.&lt;/strong&gt;, Department of Mechatronics Engineering, &lt;strong&gt;Hanoi University of Industry (HAUI)&lt;/strong&gt;, Hanoi, Vietnam, 2021.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B.S.&lt;/strong&gt;, Department of Mechatronics Engineering, &lt;strong&gt;Hanoi University of Industry (HAUI)&lt;/strong&gt;, Hanoi, Vietnam, 2019.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;experience&#34;&gt;Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assistant Professor&lt;/strong&gt;, Department of Mechatronics Engineering, &lt;strong&gt;School of Mechanical and Automotive Engineering (SMAE)&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Hanoi University of Industry (HAUI)&lt;/strong&gt;, Hanoi, Vietnam. (Aug. 2026 - present).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graduate Research Assistant&lt;/strong&gt;, Department of Mechanical Engineering, &lt;strong&gt;National Cheng Kung University (NCKU)&lt;/strong&gt;, Tainan, Taiwan. (Mar. 2022 - Jun. 2026).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research Assistant&lt;/strong&gt;, Department of Mechanical Engineering, &lt;strong&gt;University of Economics - Technology for Industries (UNETI)&lt;/strong&gt;, Hanoi, Vietnam. (Aug. 2021 - Feb. 2022).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graduate Research Assistant&lt;/strong&gt;, Department of Mechanical Engineering, &lt;strong&gt;Hanoi University of Industry (HAUI)&lt;/strong&gt;, Hanoi, Vietnam. (Aug. 2019 - Jun. 2021).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;honors-and-awards&#34;&gt;Honors and Awards&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Scholarship&lt;/strong&gt;, National Cheng Kung University (NCKU), Taiwan, 2022 – 2026.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Award&lt;/strong&gt;, National Science and Technology Council (NSTC), Taiwan, 2024.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Scholarship&lt;/strong&gt;, Foxconn Technology Group, Vietnam, 2017, 2018.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;services-and-activities&#34;&gt;Services and Activities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;journal-reviewer&#34;&gt;Journal Reviewer:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;IEEE/ASME Transactions on Mechatronics&lt;/em&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;TMECH&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;IEEE Transactions on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics: Systems&lt;/em&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;TSMC&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Journal of the Franklin Institute&lt;/em&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;JFI&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;conference-reviewer&#34;&gt;Conference Reviewer:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;IEEE International Conference on Robotics and Automation&lt;/em&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;ICRA&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;IEEE/RSJ International Conference on Intelligent Robots and Systems&lt;/em&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;IROS&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;IEEE/ASME International Conference on Advanced Intelligent Mechatronics&lt;/em&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;AIM&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;IEEE International Conference on Systems, Man, and Cybernetics&lt;/em&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;SMC&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;IEEE-RAS International Conference on Humanoid Robots&lt;/em&gt; (&lt;strong&gt;Humanoids&lt;/strong&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
    </item>
    
